    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Shield Training)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Shield Bash.</strong> If you attack a creature within 5 feet of you as part of the Attack action and hit it with a Melee weapon, you can immediately bash it with your equipped Shield: it must make a Strength saving throw (DC 8 plus your Strength modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failure, you either push it 5 feet away from you or give it the Prone condition (your choice). You can use this benefit only once on each of your turns.</p><p><strong>Interpose Shield.</strong> If you're subjected to an effect that allows you to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, you can take a Reaction to take no damage instead if you succeed on the save while holding a Shield.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-DTeDfmsaTNDpwnoL\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>On a failed Shield Bash, push the target or give it the Prone condition.</p></section>",
